<p><a href="/wiki/%E6%B3%95%E7%9B%8A" title="法益">法益</a><br />
<a href="/wiki/%E9%98%BB%E5%8D%BB%E9%81%95%E6%B3%95%E4%BA%8B%E7%94%B1" title="阻卻違法事由">阻卻違法事由</a><br />
